Package: scAgentKit
Type: Package
Title: Human-in-the-Loop, Auditable scRNA-Seq Toolkit
Version: 0.8.0.9001
Authors@R: person(given = "Changhao", family = "Kan",
                  email = "kch_ynu@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Experimental single-cell RNA-seq workflow with explicit scientific
    review, exact input identity, immutable checkpoints, bounded optional model
    requests and local browser/R clients of one project engine. Includes measured
    QC and clustering evidence, manual annotation, scoped child projects and
    standalone Seurat plotting, marker, reference and ontology utilities.
    Evidence and workflow completion do not establish biological accuracy.
    Includes an offline ACT reference snapshot with fixed source provenance.
